  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 2302.44 Surface waters of the state",
  "priorExpiration": "2024-07-25",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 2302.44 “Surface waters of the state” means perennial and seasonal streams, lakes, ponds, and tidal waters within the jurisdiction of the state, including all streams, lakes, or ponds bordering on the state, marshes, water courses, and other bodies of water, natural, or artificial.\n\nSource. #13858, INTERIM, eff 1-27-24, EXPIRED: 7-25-24\n\nNew. #14078, eff 9-24-24",
